-A request for “paprika extract” leaves two important decisions open: are you buying red colour or chilli heat, and does the ingredient need to enter an oil phase or disperse through an aqueous recipe? The JECFA technical assessment distinguishes low-pungency colouring extracts from pungent capsicum oleoresins, and describes both oil-standardized extracts and water-dispersible preparations made with food emulsifiers.[2]
